      "sourceTextSha256": "da11a62abc67b01b7894e22980ff61e214d91dea9d800b4424c334e9f6f07542",
      "text": "After breakfast, we set off by bus to Machu Picchu. Its a 30-minute bus ride up to Machu Picchu. Machu Picchu, an Inca city with a maze of fine stone temples, houses and fountains, spectacularly situated on a ridge between two peaks. Hidden by dense vegetation when Hiram Bingham discovered it in 1911. There you have a guided tour. After the tour we take the train back to Cuzco. Overnight in Cuzco",
